think Picked up the running thread: read KYRI + RADIANT_STYLE (voice first), then REMEMBER, the top three README rows, and the newest recommend line. The lasso_select lap just landed and named the next crux -- a further scene read (sort/filter a selection by joined facts, an object-count-in-region summary, a per-selection descriptor join) or a codec read. Not a set boundary, so no REMEMBER condense; take the next lap.
